        2026-09-08, campaign 3: deliverable (7) - "the battery/volume/brightness widgets consolidate
        into ONE Settings widget" - is retired one step further. The one Settings widget is gone from
        Home too; battery, volume and brightness are a single readings chip in the bar's machine
        cluster, and Settings opens from the account chip's popover (settings.open). The user's
        instruction behind (7) was that these should be one thing rather than three, and that still
        holds - it is now one thing on the bar instead of one thing on Home. Deliverables (1)-(6)
        stand. See @legeos.observation.home-chrome-retired-to-the-bar-and-the-garden.
        """
    acceptance {
        check body-drag {
            statement """
